  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "台文通訊BONG報371期-編輯室ê話"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">2024年底ê「全國台語政策民間會議」，hōo lán來探討現此時台語復振ê狀況；〈本土語言政策ê再轉型正義〉tsit篇記錄，招逐家思考「語言復振」ê概念kah政策修正ê方向。2--月世界母語日mā是提醒lán〈回復台語〉ê日子。〈用台語認bat lán ê環境——kah囡仔做伙學台語ê感想〉、〈免驚歹勢，lán tshuā頭來講台語〉，描寫有志用台語kah人交陪、學智識。來讀〈少年本土語創作者ê挑戰、進修hām未來創作發展——客語、台語、Siraya語做例〉，聽黃稚嘉用本土語言創作音樂ê心聲。〈台語欠詞按怎補？〉，ǹg望lán想新詞ê事工無停睏，hōo「台語」tsit欉樹栽koh開花結子。&nbsp;</span></div><div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjP5Oa5As3k6CkLfdi12x1rG6YUMrOqtzZU_VtpYPhW3C8a5__5reDlB9KzmsnNuSOD9Lma7GZoWx81Li7h1byofTpoqgx9S2rlzxQzjR0c3Euo0nof49mXskl1ypVXr3kAl1gfxlrWadf2fvcf2s6b28s4JBMTtgLO8cAzUalwXvwbJ36-VJlCxr2zRmrM/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1371%E6%9C%9F_%E7%B7%A8%E8%BC%AF.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjP5Oa5As3k6CkLfdi12x1rG6YUMrOqtzZU_VtpYPhW3C8a5__5reDlB9KzmsnNuSOD9Lma7GZoWx81Li7h1byofTpoqgx9S2rlzxQzjR0c3Euo0nof49mXskl1ypVXr3kAl1gfxlrWadf2fvcf2s6b28s4JBMTtgLO8cAzUalwXvwbJ36-VJlCxr2zRmrM/w458-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1371%E6%9C%9F_%E7%B7%A8%E8%BC%AF.jpg\" width=\"458\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a name='more'></a><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh-oj4pjXlqh0g-wtg0GJI4ztOB4X4CvR9tds6y-BDitMOyNTDR0m7UHiCKNpwOBXlkwyBC0h8mU-Gwvhg7YCMhpV53TaRa0B1OEJpfMhWkDwBYMSSQqpybLRWBkbh-nRyCkQEV8UrjIfVYII3ZsL-fiVwRNTT8AvxvTyfpKh-hZR2sjmUfSyJxPF200lji/s1424/371%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG